faqs.a:
White Label is included in Tier 4.
It allows you to customize inTouch with:

· a dedicated domain for platform access and link tracking;
· your own platform name, logo, and visual branding;
· White Label APIs;
· dedicated API documentation available through a custom URL;
· White Label webhooks;
· additional advanced settings.

Sub-accounts and multiple users are not included in the AppSumo Lifetime Deal. These are separate options that can be purchased directly from rdcom if needed.
For more information about these additional options, contact us at [email redacted].
